        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "dbf9ee74-cd88-5553-9ef3-b278329a8c87",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Films: Dhool\n- People: Dharani, Vikram, Jyothika, Reemma Sen, Vivek, Sayaji Shinde, Telangana Sakunthala, Pasupathy, Kennedy John Victor\n- Roles: actor, director\n- Awards: Filmfare Awards, National Film Award, Tamil Nadu State Film Award, Honorary Doctorate\n- Organizations: People's University of Milan\n\nFacts:\n- Dhool is a 2003 Indian Tamil-language action masala film directed by Dharani.\n- Dhool stars Vikram, Jyothika, and Reemma Sen in lead roles.\n- Dhool features Vivek, Sayaji Shinde, Telangana Sakunthala, and Pasupathy in supporting roles.\n- Kennedy John Victor is professionally known as Vikram or Chiyaan Vikram.\n- Vikram is an Indian film actor who predominantly appears in Tamil-language films.\n- Vikram has won seven Filmfare Awards, one National Film Award, and one Tamil Nadu State Film Award.\n- In May 2011, the People's University of Milan awarded Vikram an Honorary Doctorate.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
